==============================================================================
A6.2 note
==============================================================================
  The side channel holds the model fixed, so it isolates
  superposition from every other difference. It does NOT reproduce
  rate_delta's own training, where the gate consumes c_t and so
  changes the e_t distribution the memory sees. Retraining was not
  run (one more 800-step fit on a loaded shared machine) and would
  reintroduce the model confound this section exists to remove.
